{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "urn:atlas:schema:r2-windows-debug-runtime-discovery:2",
  "title": "Atlas R2.0 Windows debug runtime discovery artifacts v2",
  "description": "Closed structural schema for three incomplete, non-authoritative Windows DEBUG_PROCESS discovery artifacts produced from one bounded R2.0 prototype execution.",
  "$comment": "DEBUG_PROCESS and Job Object reconciliation can bind the fixed process tree for this one execution, but image events remain incomplete for persistent file identity, mapped or loaded bytes, manual or anonymous executable mappings, static or loader closure, platform state, losslessness, qualification, promotion, and Release 3 authority. Python validation remains authoritative for canonical bytes, contiguous row ordering, event-state transitions, count joins, token joins, digest joins, and cross-document equality.",
