      "const": "Windows DEBUG_PROCESS process and image events cross-checked against one non-breakaway Job Object for one R2.0 prototype execution only; process lifetime coverage is bounded to that fixed execution, while image events remain incomplete for mapped-byte identity, manual or anonymous executable mappings, loader closure, losslessness, exact runtime closure, budget, qualification, promotion, or Release 3 authority."
